source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: An escaped `|` is a literal character inside plain text and does not split the row.
-- input.jira --
||h1||h2||
|a\|b|c|
